{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14414","headline":"怀素上人草书歌 · 戴叔伦","name":"怀素上人草书歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚僧怀素工草书，古法尽能新有余。\n神清骨竦意真率，醉来爲我挥健笔。\n始从破体变风姿，一一花开春景迟。\n忽爲壮丽就枯涩，龙蛇腾盘兽屹立。\n驰毫骤墨剧奔驷，满座失声看不及。\n心手相师势转奇，诡形怪状翻合宜。\n人人细问此中妙，怀素自言初不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14414.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14414","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}